/-
Johnson/Desc/ProofFile/Honest/K4/Law/ExchangeTenth.lean: CONDITIONAL.

What is here. The thread's debt `ExchangeAtS` at the own item of the member of the feed-forward
layers' own rounds (sub-protocol K4), at the thread with the library's own values (`lettersHead`,
Honest/Thread/FirstHead.lean): BEHIND THE MEMBER's STEP ONE SENTENCE IS LEFT, `JoinWorth`. What is
had here, and from which statement: front (`front_head`) · hRd, at the frame's own list `csHead`
(`rd_csHead`) · the tie on what the lookup has heard, down to a sentence on the parameter `look`
alone (`lookTie_k3`) · the tie on symbols (`symsTie_head`) · hTok, down to a sentence on the public
instance (`tok_head`) · behind the step: the four returns of the embedding (`emb_returns_stand`),
