it, from hypotheses of its own. THE ARROW: the exchange at the member's own item leans on the
thread's debt `Behind` at the same member; `k4_behind_all` names no exchange among its hypotheses:
no circle. THE CLAUSES OF THE THREAD THAT ARE SPENT: the sentences of the open items worth "planes"
and worth "rider" and of the item `constr m .idn`, and what the public item `.left m` says beside
